  "description": "This package is not an official release. For author information and open-source license terms, please refer to the official [open-source repository](https://github.com/mz-automation/libiec61850) and [the official website](https://libiec61850.com/libiec61850-now-on-github/).\n\t\t\tBased on the official open-source library, this package self-compiles dynamic link libraries for multiple platforms: linux-arm64 (libiec61850.so), linux-x64 (libiec61850.so), win-x64 (iec61850.dll) and win-arm64 (iec61850.dll). These binaries are integrated into the official .NET project for packaging.\n\t\t\tThis package is for testing purposes only, and no functional warranty is provided. Should any copyright infringement exist, I will remove this package immediately upon notification.本包非官方发布，是基于官方的开源库，自己编译了linux-arm64（libiec61850.so），linux-x64（libiec61850.so），win-x64（iec61850.dll），win-arm64（iec61850.dll）平台的动态链接库添加到官方的.Net项目中打包，仅供测试，如有侵权，联系后，我会立即删除",
